TEXT 168 -552 Left 2 !.param LM=10m\n.param n=2\n.param L=200u\n.param f=100k\n.param VB=10\n.param k=2*L*f/R\n.param D=0.4\n.param R=200\n.param Vo=2*n*VB/(1 + sqrt( 1 + 4*k/D**2 ) )
TEXT 832 -552 Left 2 !.param ksd= (n*D/(L*f)) * (n*VB - Vo)\n.param kso= - (n*D**2)/(2*L*f)\n.param ksb= (n**2*D**2)/(2*L*f)\n \n.param kd1d= (D/(L*f)) * (n*VB - Vo)\n.param kd1o= -(D**2)/(2*L*f)\n.param kd1b= (n*D**2)/(2*L*f)\n \n \n.param kd2d=(D/(L*f)) * (n*VB  - Vo)**2/Vo\n.param kd2o=-(D**2/(2*L*f)) * (n**2*VB**2/Vo**2 - 1)\n.param kd2b=(n*D**2/(L*f))*(n*VB/Vo - 1)
